<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia soyabean oil shipments Feb. 1-28..</title>
<headline>Indonesia soyabean oil shipments Feb. 1-28..</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shipments of soyabean oil and its products from Belawan port in North Sumatra in February, 1997, based on data made available to Reuters by the port authority.</p>
<p>* asterisk denotes export destinations.</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>SHIP		DATE/DEPARTURE	CARGO/TONNES     DESTINATION</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>MV Wanru	     14-02-97	   soya bean meal   S'pore*</p>
<p>						12,867 tns</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>KM Cipta Niaga     23-02-97	   soya bean meal   Belawan*</p>
<p>						320 tns</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
